OK, here is what I would do in your shoes. First, the castle has a 
guaranteed 4 dragons behind the hidden doors in the corridor where all 
the trap doors to the VotD are located. One of them may be silver - it 
will depend, since they are (as far as I know) randomly generated. I 
have seen all kinds of colored dragons there - you might get a silver 
dragon hide that you can turn into suit of mail with a blessed ?oEA. In 
any case, I would hold out and be patient to try and get the armor 
without a wish.

Using the scroll to reverse geno dragons seems risky. If you feel OK 
about it, however, I might go ahead and try on a level where I can 
teleport to safety if it gets hairy.

I have never found anything decent in Orcus-town, mimics or not. I don't 
know what the code looks like for generating those items but it always 
seems like junk.

I would save the wand of poly for spellbooks and scrolls. Shove all 
those useless books and scrolls in a pile - you might get lucky.

Don't hold your breath about a helm of brilliance. They aren't generated 
  all the time and you might do better with a leather elven helm.

But it sounds like you are off to a good start and with some work you 
can probably pull it off.


